{"4050080": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Undelve", "steam_appid": 4050080, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4050080/extras/a65541109ac01a3348b1e36c931fe92a.poster.avif?t=1783117236\" aria-hidden=\"true\"width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4050080/extras/a65541109ac01a3348b1e36c931fe92a.webm?t=1783117236\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4050080/extras/a65541109ac01a3348b1e36c931fe92a.mp4?t=1783117236\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Escape from the core of a spider-infested planet, gathering the scraps of your torn-apart ship and crew to survive as you forcefully fight waves of enemies to escape. Though you were never supposed to land, remember what you came here for... This planet's complete and total eradication.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Just escaping isn't enough...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4050080/extras/3bedb19dd1601c04955faa0474c34db9.avif?t=1783117236\" alt=\"About the game\" width=616 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Undelve is a 2D Looter Shooter all about the balance between two things: your items, which give you both passive and active buffs, and your matter, which is what most weapons use to reload their ammo. Without items, you won't be strong enough to escape, but without matter, forget about reloading your gun.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you explore through spider-infested tunnels, find the explosive mines littered around the world left by your ship, charge them up, and obliterate each zone one by one till no spider remains; however, each area has increasingly wild enemies that you must learn to adapt to.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With multiple endings, the way to victory is up to you...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4050080/extras/db72414028bdbefc54b416339c874c33.poster.avif?t=1783117236\" aria-hidden=\"true\"width=616 height=274 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4050080/extras/db72414028bdbefc54b416339c874c33.webm?t=1783117236\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4050080/extras/db72414028bdbefc54b416339c874c33.mp4?t=1783117236\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are a dozen characters to pick from, all with unique loadouts, including different starting weapons, items, and special &quot;dash&quot; abilities. Each character has a favorite playstyle and leans towards some item builds, but if you're determined or lucky enough, any character can flourish with any item synergy. Start with the Commando and unlock the other 11 characters over time via Steam achievements.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4050080/extras/750de8243c286a444d16c6915d87cee9.avif?t=1783117236\" alt=\"\"width=616 height=256 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With 100 items, 20+ weapons, and many more consumables, no two runs will ever be the same.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >88 of the items (all but blue tier) are unlocked via Steam achievements and are instantly added to your game the moment the achievement is achieved, no need to restart the run for it to enter the item pool.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4050080/extras/a3335a6514ece9e49669693a88d77371.avif?t=1783117236\" alt=\"I could go on and on but...\" width=616 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I'd rather not spoil everything. If you read this far and think what you read sounded interesting,  wishlist it and go try out the Demo!</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4050080/extras/a65541109ac01a3348b1e36c931fe92a.poster.avif?t=1783117236\" aria-hidden=\"true\"width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4050080/extras/a65541109ac01a3348b1e36c931fe92a.webm?t=1783117236\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4050080/extras/a65541109ac01a3348b1e36c931fe92a.mp4?t=1783117236\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Escape from the core of a spider-infested planet, gathering the scraps of your torn-apart ship and crew to survive as you forcefully fight waves of enemies to escape. Though you were never supposed to land, remember what you came here for... This planet's complete and total eradication.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Just escaping isn't enough...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4050080/extras/3bedb19dd1601c04955faa0474c34db9.avif?t=1783117236\" alt=\"About the game\" width=616 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Undelve is a 2D Looter Shooter all about the balance between two things: your items, which give you both passive and active buffs, and your matter, which is what most weapons use to reload their ammo. Without items, you won't be strong enough to escape, but without matter, forget about reloading your gun.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you explore through spider-infested tunnels, find the explosive mines littered around the world left by your ship, charge them up, and obliterate each zone one by one till no spider remains; however, each area has increasingly wild enemies that you must learn to adapt to.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With multiple endings, the way to victory is up to you...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4050080/extras/db72414028bdbefc54b416339c874c33.poster.avif?t=1783117236\" aria-hidden=\"true\"width=616 height=274 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4050080/extras/db72414028bdbefc54b416339c874c33.webm?t=1783117236\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4050080/extras/db72414028bdbefc54b416339c874c33.mp4?t=1783117236\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are a dozen characters to pick from, all with unique loadouts, including different starting weapons, items, and special &quot;dash&quot; abilities. Each character has a favorite playstyle and leans towards some item builds, but if you're determined or lucky enough, any character can flourish with any item synergy. Start with the Commando and unlock the other 11 characters over time via Steam achievements.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4050080/extras/750de8243c286a444d16c6915d87cee9.avif?t=1783117236\" alt=\"\"width=616 height=256 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With 100 items, 20+ weapons, and many more consumables, no two runs will ever be the same.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >88 of the items (all but blue tier) are unlocked via Steam achievements and are instantly added to your game the moment the achievement is achieved, no need to restart the run for it to enter the item pool.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4050080/extras/a3335a6514ece9e49669693a88d77371.avif?t=1783117236\" alt=\"I could go on and on but...\" width=616 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I'd rather not spoil everything. If you read this far and think what you read sounded interesting,  wishlist it and go try out the Demo!</p>", "short_description": "A 2D Sci-fi Action Looter Shooter. Collect items and decide which to scrap for ammo while exploring a vast cave system, blowing up the very tunnels spiders use to reach you.", "supported_languages": "English", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4050080/32ce107f4b985e31ecea3c6fff29408948f2c807/header.jpg?t=1783117236", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4050080/10777e4da36f26960eb308123b691d92727d9f68/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1783117236", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4050080/10777e4da36f26960eb308123b691d92727d9f68/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1783117236", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i3-2100 | AMD Phenom II X4 965<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4000 MB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Intel HD Graphics 4000<br><